resources.string:
"1. Coins can be used to redeem ad-exemption benefit or equivalent VIP benefit. The redemption operation is irrevocable, and the consumed coins will be converted into corresponding benefit;

2. Ad-exemption benefit: completely exempt from advertising during the effective period, especially when starting the VM;
Equivalent VIP benefit: the same benefit as the purchased VIP, including no ads and unlocking all features;

3. Each one can only redeem one benefit at a time, and new benefit can be redeemed again only after the current expires. VIP do not need to redeem any benefit, because VIP enjoy all the benefits;

4. We have the right to adjust the redemption rules when necessary, including the redemption price, redeemable benefit, and even suspend redemption;

5. Note: The redeemed benefit are bound to this device. Uninstalling & reinstalling or switching device will both result in the loss of benefit."

"1. You earned coins each time you rewarded from the ads, which can be used to redeem in-app benefits. For details, please see the Free VIP Plan;

2. The time and number of times you can watch each day are limited. You can no longer get coins by watching ads during non-opening hours or when the number limit is reached;

3. Based on the your time zone, the time and number limit will be recalculated after 00:00 every day;

4. We have the right to adjust the rules when necessary, including the number of coins, the time and the number limit, or even suspend it;

5. Note: The coins earned are bound to this device. Uninstalling & reinstalling or switching device will both result in the loss of coins."
